# OSOVM witness_bridge — Sui TESTNET deployment (verified on-chain 2026-08-27)
#
# The techgnosis package containing proof_of_witness is published on testnet
# (chain-id 4c78adac). Its init() created and shared the WitnessOracle and
# SensorRegistry at publish time. These are the real object IDs, recovered from
# the publish transaction (CLXmibXkUA4uQkmjJ6xobrfNWJtyswcbm47TPGdsiGZs), not
# placeholders.
#
# Usage: source testnet.env, then
#   witness-bridge register-sensor   --package "$PACKAGE_ID" --oracle "$ORACLE_ID" --registry "$REGISTRY_ID" ...
#   witness-bridge submit-attestation --package "$PACKAGE_ID" --oracle "$ORACLE_ID" --registry "$REGISTRY_ID" ...
#   witness-bridge submit-witness    --package "$PACKAGE_ID" --oracle "$ORACLE_ID" --registry "$REGISTRY_ID" ...

